  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tonga Transport Sector Consolidation Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Project is to assist the Recipient to develop its transport sector to have: (i) stronger policy, planning and regulatory institutions and framework; (ii) improved safety and security facilities and compliance with international safety and security standards; and (iii) greater domestic capacity for road rehabilitation and maintenance.</narrative>
  </description>
